(Accelerometer-measured physical activity, sedentary behavior, and incident ) Tj T*
(neuropsychiatric diseases: a large prospective cohort study of 73411 ) Tj T*
(participants) Tj T*
/F2 10 Tf
14 TL
() Tj T*
(Wu JY, Li YZ, Zhang DD, Gao PY, Fu Y, Zhang W, Feng JF, Zhang YR, Cheng W, Yu JT. Molecular ) Tj T*
(Psychiatry. 2026 Mar; 31\(3\):1485-1499 \(published online 20 Sep 2025\). DOI: ) Tj T*
